@startuml
skinparam dpi 240
title Scora — End-to-End User Flow
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 16
skinparam defaultFontName "Readex Pro"
skinparam defaultFontColor #163126
skinparam ArrowColor #084C2D
skinparam activityBorderColor #16A34A
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F0FAF3
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #084C2D
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFFFFF

|Developer|
start
:Create account & choose skill track;
:Accept assessment and AI-use policy;
:Complete fundamentals checkpoint\n(AI restricted);
:Complete engineering challenge\n(AI allowed and declared);

|Scora Platform|
:Run code in isolated sandbox;
:Execute tests and static analysis;

|Developer|
:Complete code-grounded AI interview;
:Diagnose and repair a hidden defect;
:Implement a live requirement change;

|Scora Platform|
:Evaluate mandatory ownership gates;
if (Ownership gates passed?) then (Yes)
  :Combine correctness, quality,\nownership and integrity evidence;
  if (High confidence?) then (Yes)
    :Calculate SP, Trust Score\nand evidence confidence;
  else (No)
    |Human Reviewer|
    :Inspect evidence and rubric;
    :Confirm, adjust, or request follow-up;
    |Scora Platform|
    :Calculate versioned final result;
  endif
  :Publish verified Technical Report\nand Developer Passport;
else (No)
  :Keep skill track unverified;
  :Publish evidence-based feedback;
endif

|Developer|
if (Appeal or reassess?) then (Yes)
  |Human Reviewer|
  :Review appeal evidence;
  |Scora Platform|
  :Record reasoned decision;
endif

|Client|
:Describe project requirements;
:Search verified-only developer pool;
:Compare evidence, recency,\nconfidence and availability;
:Shortlist and contact developer;
stop
@enduml
